  "stdlib": {
    "$comment": [
      "The constructor ABI (plan P2-03; docs/ctor-design.md). A kind's \"ctor\" is its public constructor:",
      "name (default: the kind), params bound left to right (attr:NAME[:DOMAIN] | projected:NAME | text |",
      "lines | body), nullary (a bare #name calls it), sealed (no override); every attribute not bound",
      "positionally is an option. Here: the derived constructors (kind: the node they make; options \"raw\":",
      "the options object reaches the implementation unvalidated), the std functions and the option aliases.",
      "The names reach the hole module and the manifest from these tables; the implementations live in",
      "runtime/src/shared/stdlib.mjs."],
    "aliases": {"float": "side", "width": "w", "height": "h"},
    "ctors": {
      "strong": {"kind": "styled"},
      "em": {"kind": "styled"},
      "style": {"kind": "styled", "options": "raw"},
      "figure": {"kind": "group", "params": ["body"], "options": "raw"},
      "toc": {"kind": "collect", "nullary": true},
      "glossary": {"kind": "collect", "nullary": true},
      "notes": {"kind": "collect", "nullary": true},
      "bibliography": {"kind": "collect", "params": ["attr:src:str"], "options": "raw"},
      "node": {"params": ["attr:kind:ident"], "options": "raw", "sealed": true}},
    "functions": ["val", "m", "plain"]},
  "domains": {
    "$comment": [
      "Textual value domains (plan P1-02): a byte-level regular expression (whole-string match) and a",
      "maximum UTF-8 length (0 = none). tools/gen-schema.mjs compiles each to a DFA for C++ (the ops",
      "reader's authoritative check) and to a RegExp for JS; \\x80-\\xff means any non-ASCII character."
    ],
    "ident": {
      "max": 64,
      "re": "[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_\\-]*"
    },
    "label": {
      "max": 512,
      "re": "[^\\x00-\\x1f\\x7f]+"
    },
    "lang": {
      "max": 64,
      "re": "[A-Za-z]{2,8}(-[A-Za-z0-9]{1,8})*"
    },
    "rangeset": {
      "max": 0,
      "re": " *[0-9]{1,7} *(- *[0-9]{1,7} *)?(, *[0-9]{1,7} *(- *[0-9]{1,7} *)?)*"
    },
    "color": {
      "max": 64,
      "re": "#([0-9A-Fa-f]{3}|[0-9A-Fa-f]{4}|[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}|[0-9A-Fa-f]{8})|var\\(--[A-Za-z0-9_\\-]+\\)|(rgb|rgba|hsl|hsla)\\([0-9.,/ %deg\\-]*\\)|[A-Za-z]+"
    },
    "font": {
      "max": 512,
      "re": " *(\"[^\"'\\\\\\x00-\\x1f\\x7f]+\" *|'[^\"'\\\\\\x00-\\x1f\\x7f]+' *|[A-Za-z0-9_\\-\\x80-\\xff][A-Za-z0-9 _\\-\\x80-\\xff]*)(, *(\"[^\"'\\\\\\x00-\\x1f\\x7f]+\" *|'[^\"'\\\\\\x00-\\x1f\\x7f]+' *|[A-Za-z0-9_\\-\\x80-\\xff][A-Za-z0-9 _\\-\\x80-\\xff]*))*"
    },
    "copy": {
      "max": 1024,
      "re": "text|omit|replace:[^\\x00-\\x08\\x0b-\\x1f\\x7f]*"
    },
    "classlist": {
      "max": 512,
      "re": "[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_\\-]*( [A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_\\-]*)*"
    },
    "extname": {
      "max": 32,
      "re": "[a-z][a-z0-9\\-]*"
    },
    "features": {
      "max": 256,
      "re": "( *(\"[A-Za-z0-9]{4}\"|'[A-Za-z0-9]{4}')( +(on|off|[0-9]{1,3}))?( *, *(\"[A-Za-z0-9]{4}\"|'[A-Za-z0-9]{4}')( +(on|off|[0-9]{1,3}))?)* *)?"
    }
  },
  "props": {
